{"entries":[{"id":"lex:A1:possible","headword":"possible","goals":["everyday","work","study","general"],"senses":[{"id":"lex:A1:possible","pos":"adjective","gloss":"ممکن","meaning":"چیزی که می‌تواند اتفاق بیفتد یا انجام شود. ضدش impossible. It's possible to + فعل؛ if possible = اگر ممکن باشد.","grammar":[{"pattern":"It's possible to + verb","note":"It's possible to walk there."},{"pattern":"if possible","note":"اگر ممکن باشد"},{"pattern":"as … as possible","note":"as soon as possible = هرچه زودتر"}],"examples":[{"en":"Is it possible to change my ticket?","fa":"ممکن است بلیتم را عوض کنم؟"},{"en":"Please come early if possible.","fa":"اگر ممکن است، زود بیا."}],"collocations":["if possible","as soon as possible","it's possible","the best possible"],"mistake":{"wrong":"Is it possible you open the window?","right":"Could you open the window?","why":"برای خواهش مؤدبانه Could you …? می‌گوییم."},"pronunciation":{"gb":"/ˈpɒsəbl/","us":"/ˈpɑːsəbl/","note":"تکیه روی بخش اول است: «پاسِبِل»."},"check":[{"type":"cloze","id":"c1","text":"Call me as soon as ___.","answer":"possible","accept":[],"fa":"هرچه زودتر به من زنگ بزن.","why":"as soon as possible."},{"type":"choice","id":"q1","prompt":"Is it ___ to buy tickets online?","options":[{"text":"possible","ok":true,"why":"It's possible to + فعل."},{"text":"possibly","ok":false,"why":"possibly قید است."},{"text":"possibility","ok":false,"why":"possibility اسم است."}]},{"type":"produce","id":"p1","prompt":"اگر ممکن است، فردا بیا.","frame":"Come tomorrow, if ___.","answer":"possible","accept":[],"why":"if possible."}]}],"version":"27371631dbc5","order":500,"released":false},{"id":"lex:A1:quick","headword":"quick","goals":["everyday","work","study","general"],"senses":[{"id":"lex:A1:quick","pos":"adjective","gloss":"سریع؛ کوتاه","meaning":"چیزی که زمان کمی می‌گیرد (a quick question)، یا کسی که سریع کار می‌کند. قیدش quickly است.","grammar":[{"pattern":"a quick + noun","note":"a quick question, a quick lunch"},{"pattern":"quick / quickly","note":"صفت / قید"},{"pattern":"Be quick!","note":"عجله کن!"}],"examples":[{"en":"Can I ask you a quick question?","fa":"می‌توانم یک سؤال کوتاه بپرسم؟"},{"en":"We had a quick lunch and went back to work.","fa":"یک ناهار سریع خوردیم و برگشتیم سر کار."}],"collocations":["a quick question","a quick look","be quick","a quick lunch"],"mistake":{"wrong":"I have a question quick.","right":"I have a quick question.","why":"صفت قبل از اسم می‌آید."},"pronunciation":{"gb":"/kwɪk/","us":"/kwɪk/"},"check":[{"type":"cloze","id":"c1","text":"I'm just going out for a ___ walk. I'll be back in ten minutes.","answer":"quick","accept":["short"],"fa":"فقط برای یک پیاده‌روی کوتاه بیرون می‌روم. ده دقیقه دیگر برمی‌گردم.","why":"a quick walk."},{"type":"choice","id":"q1","prompt":"Be ___! The bus is leaving.","options":[{"text":"quick","ok":true,"why":"بعد از be صفت می‌آید."},{"text":"quickly","ok":false,"why":"quickly قید است."},{"text":"quickness","ok":false,"why":"quickness اسم است."}]},{"type":"produce","id":"p1","prompt":"یک نگاه سریع بینداز.","frame":"Have a ___ look.","answer":"quick","accept":[],"why":"a quick look."}]}],"version":"8fc35dc5d056","order":501,"released":false},{"id":"lex:A1:reason","headword":"reason","goals":["everyday","work","study","general"],"senses":[{"id":"lex:A1:reason","pos":"noun","gloss":"دلیل","meaning":"چیزی که توضیح می‌دهد چرا اتفاقی افتاده. the reason for + اسم؛ the reason why + جمله.","grammar":[{"pattern":"the reason for + noun","note":"the reason for the change"},{"pattern":"the reason why + clause","note":"the reason why I'm late"},{"pattern":"for this reason","note":"به همین دلیل"}],"examples":[{"en":"What's the reason for your visit?","fa":"دلیل آمدنت چیست؟"},{"en":"There's no reason to be angry.","fa":"دلیلی برای عصبانی بودن نیست."}],"collocations":["the main reason","for this reason","a good reason","no reason"],"mistake":{"wrong":"What is the reason of this problem?","right":"What is the reason for this problem?","why":"دلیلِ چیزی: the reaso